                                                "sense_id": "794c083b-aae6-3271-8d6a-295bcf359b35",
                                                "text": "1996 Scott V Wright - Managing Hazardous Materials Incidents Volume II\nSome examples of these adverse effects, sometimes called toxic end points, include carcinogenicity (development of cancer), hepatotoxicity (liver damage), […]"
